    #     mozil‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡·‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡‡la: SHA1(modulus) for RSA, SHA1(pub) for DSA
    #     rfc2459: SHA1(SequenceASN1 of public key components as ASN1 integers)
